# --- Secrets: never commit real values here ---
# The public tree ships these two as EMPTY templates (key names only).
# The negation lines below keep them tracked so downloaders can see which
# keys to fill in. Replace the empty values locally — never commit them.
!config/skynet.env
!config/deploy.env
